WEBVTT

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:05.040
Early morning training?

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:08.090
<i>Yeah! Trainer's taking 
me out tomorrow morning,</i>

00:00:08.090 --> 00:00:10.440
<i>and I wondered if you wanted to come along.</i>

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:15.620
Thank you for asking. I believe 
I'll take you up on that offer.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:18.120
<i>Great! I'll be waiting tomorrow, then.</i>

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:20.120
Right. See you then.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:21.870
<i>Yeah! Goodnight.</i>

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
<i>Teio... I will strive to remain the strongest,</i>

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.050
<i>in anticipation of the day you return.</i>

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:37.920
<i>I won't lose, no matter what.</i>

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:09.710
<b>Umamusume</b>

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:09.710
<b><i>Pretty Derby</i></b>

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:21.720
Episode 12
\hTogether

00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:20.740
This is harder than I thought!

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:23.750
Beach sand is softer and more 
granular than what we're used to.

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:26.380
If you step forward normally, you generate

00:02:26.380 --> 00:02:28.870
an insufficient amount of propulsive force.

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:31.020
And, uh, that means?

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:35.130
It means you need to make sure your form is 
correct if you want to move effectively.

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:38.120
It's quite effective training, actually.

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:39.630
I see...

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:41.700
Okay, in that case!

00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:59.280
Goal!

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:03.660
Nice work, you two.

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:05.410
Have some hydration.

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:07.420
Thanks, Trainer!

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:08.910
Much obliged.

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:14.610
You don't have to match my pace, y'know.

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:15.170
Excuse me?

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:18.270
You could've gone faster, right, McQueen?

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:20.340
Well, yes.

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:28.400
Trainer-san, would it be all right if I did
a bit of independent training for a while?

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:29.430
On your own?

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:34.440
Yes. There are a few things I've been
 considering, moving into the Fall Tennoushou.

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:37.860
I'm not gonna say no to 
you of all horse girls.

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:40.690
That said, call me if you 
need any help, all right?

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:42.250
Thank you.

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:44.320
What are you going to do 
for your solo training?

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:47.830
Well, I was thinking of 
adding pool exercises.

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:48.830
In that case...

00:03:49.050 --> 00:03:51.080
Let's go for a swim while we're here!

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:53.330
But it's already November.

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:54.330
It's fine!

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:55.990
It won't be so bad!

00:03:55.990 --> 00:03:57.970
See, it's not that...

00:03:57.970 --> 00:03:59.460
So cold!

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:00.970
I was trying to warn you...

00:04:01.770 --> 00:04:03.840
Teio, please, stop that!

00:04:02.350 --> 00:04:05.930
Seriously, it's fine! 
Once you get in, you'll feel fine!

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:07.360
Whoo!

00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:08.310
Whoo!

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:11.680
Time to have Fukukitaru-san 
check out my fortune again!

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:12.180
Yo!

00:04:12.470 --> 00:04:14.680
Fukukitaru-san, we're back!

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:17.570
Huh? She's gone?

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:19.370
Is this a note?

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:21.940
"Dear Mejiro Palmer-chan..."

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:27.310
"If you are reading this note, 
I have abandoned this location."

00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:31.200
<i>You no longer require the 
guidance of my fortunes.</i>

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:33.870
<i>You are already a splendid, 
outrunning horse girl!</i>

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:37.520
<i>As a wandering fortune teller, 
I will now head to a new destination,</i>

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:39.410
<i>along with Meisho Doto.</i>

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:42.100
Oof...

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:42.460
<i>I doubt we will ever meet again.</i>

00:04:42.460 --> 00:04:43.720
Come on.

00:04:43.490 --> 00:04:45.250
<i>Please look after yourself...</i>

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:45.250
Okay...

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:46.840
<i>Machikane Fukukitaru.</i>

00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:51.690
Fukukitaru-san!

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:55.820
Helios... I'm gonna do my best.

00:04:55.820 --> 00:04:56.460
Yo...

00:04:56.850 --> 00:05:00.550
I'm sure Fukukitaru-san 
is watching, somewhere.

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:01.320
Yo.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:04.260
All right, let's get to training!

00:05:03.260 --> 00:05:04.740
Hold it up, okay?

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:05.360
Okay...

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:06.740
Put your back into it!

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:07.490
Like this?

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:08.870
You're still here!

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.060
It's the day of the Kikkashou,

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.870
<b>Kikkashou</b>

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.870
<b>Kikkashou</b>

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.870
<b>Kikkashou</b>

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.870
<b>Kikkashou</b>

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.870
<b>Kikkashou</b>

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.870
<b>Kikkashou</b>

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.870
<b>Kikkashou</b>

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.870
<b>Kyoto Racecourse</b>

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:13.540
and here to witness a race to determine 
the strongest in a generation

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:17.370
is a capacity crowd awaiting
 BNW's latest showdown.

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:20.380
McQueen's doing more solo training, huh?

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:23.770
We better keep a good eye on 
the others for her sake, then.

00:05:23.770 --> 00:05:24.260
Good point!

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:28.130
She did a great job winning the Kyoto Daishoten,
 so I'm sure she's fine.

00:05:28.130 --> 00:05:29.100
Good point!

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:30.760
The Kikkashou...

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:32.390
Biwa Hayahide,

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:33.770
Narita Taishin,

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:35.520
and Winning Ticket.

00:05:35.760 --> 00:05:39.270
Which one of them is going 
to grab the last crown?

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:43.940
They're all really strong. 
Let's scope them out for McQueen.

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:44.930
Good idea.

00:05:59.770 --> 00:06:02.040
Miss, is something the matter?

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:04.400
It's nothing!

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:17.850
Past the fourth corner and 
entering the final straightaway,

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:19.670
Biwa Hayahide's lead is only increasing!

00:06:19.670 --> 00:06:20.540
She's in first place!

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:24.510
The only member of BNW yet to claim a crown 
looks like she's about to make her mark!

00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:27.610
On the outside, Arcade Champ and Winning Ticket
 are starting to move up!

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:29.350
But Biwa Hayahide's lead is still growing!

00:06:29.350 --> 00:06:30.650
She's in first place!

00:06:30.650 --> 00:06:32.370
With a lead of four,

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:33.330
<i>now five lengths!</i>

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:34.680
<i>The race for second place is hot!</i>

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:36.870
<i>Winning Ticket </i>is doing her 
best to push forward!

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:38.570
But look at that implacable lead!

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:40.890
Biwa Hayahide with an unassailable 
show of strength!

00:06:40.890 --> 00:06:41.880
And she crosses the goal!

00:06:42.650 --> 00:06:44.880
The final race of the 
Classics, the Kikkashou,

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:49.220
goes to the last member of 
BNW to win a race, Biwa Hayahide!

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:50.920
With a five-length lead 
on the second-place finisher!

00:06:50.920 --> 00:06:55.360
She has won the G1 race said to be won 
by only the strongest horse girls!

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:56.770
And this time...

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:58.290
<b>Record</b>

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:58.290
<b>Record</b>

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:58.290
<b>Record</b>

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:58.290
<b>Record</b>

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:58.290
<b>Record</b>

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:58.290
<b>Record</b>

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:58.290
<b>Record</b>

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.290
It's a record!

00:06:58.290 --> 00:06:59.770
<i>She's broken the record</i>

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:01.090
set previously by Rice Shower!

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:03.470
Wow...

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:06.810
She blew them away. 
How does she run like that?

00:07:06.810 --> 00:07:07.890
Good question.

00:07:07.890 --> 00:07:09.780
She's got a lot of momentum.

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:13.980
She stands out even among BNW.

00:07:13.980 --> 00:07:17.160
She must've grown a bit over the summer.

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:20.180
Nice run!

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:21.820
Something wrong?

00:07:21.820 --> 00:07:22.420
Well...

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:26.060
I could've sworn I just heard
someone say my head had grown too big.

00:07:26.060 --> 00:07:27.670
Really?

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:31.430
Well, we saw the thing. 
Let's take our time on the way back.

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:34.860
Since we're in Kyoto anyway, 
I wanna get some Nishin soba.

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:35.490
Good point!

00:07:35.490 --> 00:07:36.640
In that case, I wanna matcha parfait!

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:37.120
Good point!

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:39.420
We can get both. And it 
can be Trainer's treat.

00:07:39.420 --> 00:07:40.310
Good point!

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:42.780
Hold up! I didn't sign off on this!

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:44.640
Maybe you're imagining things?

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:47.900
No, I'm positive. 
Someone said my head was too big.

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:49.320
But are you sure you're not imagining it?

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:52.320
That can't be. Somebody had to have...

00:07:50.410 --> 00:07:52.320
You're imagining things!

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:55.340
I know what I heard! Someone said it!

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:54.590
Biwa Hayahide...

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:00.330
Butler...

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:01.060
Yes?

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:03.820
Could you call the doctor?

00:08:03.820 --> 00:08:04.830
The family doctor?

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:05.810
Yes.

00:08:05.810 --> 00:08:08.140
There's something I'd like him to look at.

00:08:08.140 --> 00:08:09.590
Miss...

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:13.660
I'm sure it's nothing serious, 
but I'd like to take every precaution.

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:15.630
Right. Understood.

00:08:15.630 --> 00:08:17.100
Here you are, miss.

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:26.520
Honestly... I just said 
it was nothing serious.

00:08:36.440 --> 00:08:39.330
Everyone, let's eat some 
of that next! Come on!

00:08:39.570 --> 00:08:41.200
B-Bring it on...

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:45.330
You still wanna eat? You're gonna wear 
down your stamina if you overdo it.

00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:48.670
You know what they say about autumn! 
Even horse girls get to enjoy harvest time.

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:49.710
I guess...

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:51.070
Me, too, then!

00:08:53.640 --> 00:08:54.340
What's up?

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:56.920
Oh, I just wanted to pick 
something up for McQueen!

00:09:03.030 --> 00:09:04.250
What do you think?

00:09:05.650 --> 00:09:08.230
I'd like you to get bed rest 
for the time being.

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:13.800
Maybe this? Or this?

00:09:13.800 --> 00:09:15.740
Or would she prefer this?

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:23.010
This seems like an overreaction.

00:09:23.010 --> 00:09:27.000
Still, until we know the diagnosis,
 it's better to be safe than sorry.

00:09:28.450 --> 00:09:29.360
Come in.

00:09:30.550 --> 00:09:32.130
I'm the doctor.

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:34.060
What did you learn, Doctor?

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:36.310
Doctor?

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:39.390
Miss, the lady of the house 
would like to speak to you.

00:09:41.610 --> 00:09:43.000
My grandmother?

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:49.020
Heave-ho, heave-ho...

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:50.400
And down.

00:09:52.180 --> 00:09:54.640
Man, nasty weather.

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:57.120
Hey, Teio.

00:09:57.120 --> 00:09:58.880
Aw, it's just you, Trainer.

00:09:58.880 --> 00:10:01.030
Wow, rude. Is there a problem?

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:03.080
No, I was just waiting for McQueen.

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:05.870
I was hoping to give her these.

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:08.790
Wait, today's the "best by" date!

00:10:06.810 --> 00:10:08.790
<b>Coarse Red Sweet Bean-Filled Yatsuhashi
Kyoto's Finest Yatsuhashi, Nishino</b>

00:10:09.870 --> 00:10:11.190
Hey, where are you going?

00:10:11.190 --> 00:10:13.160
To deliver these to McQueen!

00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:15.170
I'll visit her while I'm at it!

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:16.860
Back later!

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:20.430
Honey, honey, honey!

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:23.870
When I get a lick of that honey,

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:29.620
I feel, feel, feel so much faster!

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:32.170
Honey, honey, honey!

00:10:32.170 --> 00:10:35.190
When I get a lick of that honey...

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:40.040
All right, this oughta cover 
the next training regimen.

00:10:42.570 --> 00:10:45.090
It's... McQueen's butler?

00:10:42.570 --> 00:10:45.090
<b>Mr. Butler</b>

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:48.600
Hello?

00:10:48.600 --> 00:10:52.360
Man, this place is still intimidating.

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:55.340
How do I even get inside?

00:10:55.740 --> 00:10:57.680
Pardon me.

00:10:59.710 --> 00:11:02.340
Honey, honey, honey!

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:05.850
When I get a lick of that honey...

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:09.600
Butler-san!

00:11:11.320 --> 00:11:13.390
Teio-sama, what brings you here?

00:11:13.390 --> 00:11:15.230
Sorry for coming in without permission.

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:18.800
Is McQueen around? I came 
to visit her, and well...

00:11:18.800 --> 00:11:19.810
Well... er...

00:11:19.810 --> 00:11:20.860
Butler-san?

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:27.370
I'm afraid Miss McQueen is not available.

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:29.600
Oh, is she training? In that case...

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:33.610
She is currently staying at 
the Mejiro family sanatorium.

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:39.120
The sanatorium? Why?

00:11:39.120 --> 00:11:40.760
Did something happen to her?!

00:11:41.150 --> 00:11:44.770
An injury was discovered in her leg.

00:11:44.770 --> 00:11:45.640
What injury?

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:51.520
The young miss has developed a case of 
suspensory ligament desmitis in her left leg.

00:11:53.030 --> 00:11:54.320
That's...

00:11:55.760 --> 00:11:58.890
It requires a year to treat,

00:11:58.890 --> 00:12:03.460
and even in the event of recovery, 
it is likely to reoccur.

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:09.450
It's said to be one of the incurable 
conditions that can plague a horse girl.

00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:18.480
Unlike a fracture, it doesn't immediately 
prevent one from running. But...

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:21.260
With each step, severe pain 
will afflict the affected area,

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:24.220
with the worst case scenario being 
a permanent loss of mobility.

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:25.620
So you see...

00:12:26.860 --> 00:12:30.630
Then McQueen can't run anymore?

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:34.030
Racing would be terribly unwise.

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:38.400
If she doesn't aggravate the injury, 
it shouldn't affect her everyday life.

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:42.870
It's... what's best for her.

00:12:46.350 --> 00:12:47.490
Hello?

00:12:48.650 --> 00:12:49.990
She's missing?!

00:12:50.710 --> 00:12:53.500
No, I don't think she'd be that desperate.

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:55.350
But then, I'm not sure where...

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:57.140
Teio-sama?

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:01.670
<b>Coarse Red Sweet Bean-Filled Yatsuhashi
Kyoto's Finest Yatsuhashi, Nishino</b>

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:09.680
McQueen!

00:13:12.970 --> 00:13:16.980
<b>Umamusume</b>

00:13:12.970 --> 00:13:16.980
<b><i>Pretty Derby</i></b>

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:38.710
See, it's fine. I'm still capable of running.

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:47.720
<i>Isn't this enough?</i>

00:13:48.570 --> 00:13:51.110
You've accomplished so 
much while racing already,

00:13:51.110 --> 00:13:54.980
along with granting my wish 
of conquering the Tennoushou.

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:58.050
I could not be more proud of you.

00:13:59.210 --> 00:14:01.600
So, please, let's put an end to this.

00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:02.980
I cannot accept that!

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:05.110
I can still run!

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:08.660
You can not. Your leg has reached its limit.

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:12.450
That's how severe 
suspensory ligament desmitis is.

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:14.280
I'm asking you to please listen to me—

00:14:14.280 --> 00:14:15.350
I refuse!

00:14:15.350 --> 00:14:17.370
I do not want to give up!

00:14:17.970 --> 00:14:19.230
Miss...

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:33.900
<i>That's right. I can hardly 
let this injury stop me.</i>

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:36.520
<i>Because...</i>

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:39.800
<i>I finally found her.</i>

00:14:40.870 --> 00:14:42.730
<i>I've finally encountered an opponent</i>

00:14:43.130 --> 00:14:46.740
<i>who I can clash with seriously, 
for the rest of my life.</i>

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:51.430
<i>With you, I know I can run on forever.</i>

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:55.880
<i>I knew it was our destiny on that day.</i>

00:15:06.010 --> 00:15:09.440
Which is why... I can't let this stop me.

00:15:13.560 --> 00:15:15.820
<i>Isn't it enough?</i>

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:18.770
<i>An injury like this...</i>

00:15:20.090 --> 00:15:21.960
<i>is of no concern!</i>

00:15:23.910 --> 00:15:29.650
<i>Teio did it herself... time and time again, 
she rose to her feet and moved forward!</i>

00:15:31.120 --> 00:15:33.870
<i>After her dream of an undefeated 
triple crown was lost,</i>

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:36.280
<i>after her dream of being 
undefeated was ended,</i>

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:39.300
<i>after all the times she broke her leg...</i>

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:45.040
<i>Miss, you've developed suspensory 
ligament desmitis in your left leg.</i>

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:49.300
<i>I can still run! I'm Mejiro McQueen!</i>

00:15:49.810 --> 00:15:54.690
<i>And I will experience that moment, 
where we both give our all and run together,</i>

00:15:54.690 --> 00:15:56.490
<i>once more!</i>

00:15:59.150 --> 00:16:03.980
<i>This is an incurable condition for horse 
girls, with no effective treatment.</i>

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:07.090
<i>I will run... again...</i>

00:16:10.260 --> 00:16:12.530
I'm not gonna lose again!

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:14.470
Challenge accepted.

00:16:17.150 --> 00:16:18.980
<i>Isn't it enough?</i>

00:16:19.770 --> 00:16:22.680
<i>I promised her...</i>

00:16:23.390 --> 00:16:29.500
From this moment on, I'd be glad 
to run so as to be a goal for you.

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:34.310
I will run in a way that 
makes me fit to be your goal.

00:16:34.310 --> 00:16:35.520
Please, watch me.

00:16:36.170 --> 00:16:38.330
<i>I will continue to run...</i>

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:41.270
<i>So that I can remain the top horse girl.</i>

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:43.960
<i>Your leg has reached its limit.</i>

00:16:44.640 --> 00:16:47.570
<i>I... want that again.</i>

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:53.090
<i>To run with Teio...</i>

00:17:05.890 --> 00:17:09.320
<i>I... I...</i>

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:13.020
McQueen!

00:17:16.360 --> 00:17:17.450
Teio?

00:17:20.210 --> 00:17:21.600
McQueen!

00:17:23.900 --> 00:17:26.020
What's the matter, Teio?

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:28.520
You're in such a panic.

00:17:29.450 --> 00:17:31.610
Butler-san told me...

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:33.370
About your leg.

00:17:33.370 --> 00:17:35.280
Is that all?

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:37.780
It won't be a problem at all.

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:42.630
The Fall Tennoushou is in four days.
 I should resume training.

00:17:42.630 --> 00:17:44.430
But it has to hurt a lot, right?

00:17:44.430 --> 00:17:49.650
I can still manage to run. 
I'll simply have to bear with the pain.

00:17:50.370 --> 00:17:52.670
This won't be enough to...

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:56.210
Don't force yourself!

00:17:56.210 --> 00:17:57.650
I am not!

00:17:58.530 --> 00:17:59.940
McQueen...

00:17:59.940 --> 00:18:03.380
I must... remain strong!

00:18:04.620 --> 00:18:06.670
With dignity, never giving an inch...

00:18:07.210 --> 00:18:10.550
I have to remain in the position 
of the strongest horse girl.

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:14.940
That's where I will wait for you.

00:18:15.450 --> 00:18:17.430
I've looked forward to it for so long...

00:18:21.290 --> 00:18:23.680
We can compete to see who is the—

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:35.760
But...

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:40.340
It won't move. I can't make it move...

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:47.030
I... can't run anymore.

00:18:49.120 --> 00:18:53.750
I can't keep my promise to you!

00:19:30.610 --> 00:19:33.360
Fate's kind of a jerk, huh?

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:38.710
It really seems set on keeping 
us from racing each other.

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:47.940
I thought we'd be able to run again at the 
Takarazuka Kinen... then I broke my leg.

00:19:48.650 --> 00:19:51.920
People started saying I wouldn't be 
able to run the same way again.

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:54.720
And now, this happens to you.

00:19:56.370 --> 00:20:00.450
It'd probably be easier to just give up, huh?

00:20:00.450 --> 00:20:03.840
But... I don't want to give up yet.

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:05.800
I want to run with you again.

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:10.310
Don't you feel the same way?

00:20:10.950 --> 00:20:16.660
Of course I want to run! But I can't anymore!

00:20:16.660 --> 00:20:19.440
I may never be able to run again!

00:20:19.810 --> 00:20:23.950
Unless a miracle happens, I'll never 
be able to run like I used to!

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:26.040
Just like you!

00:20:29.690 --> 00:20:31.780
F-Forgive me...

00:20:32.530 --> 00:20:36.600
No, you're right. Without a miracle,
 it's not gonna happen.

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:39.460
So it's time to make a miracle.

00:20:40.570 --> 00:20:46.600
I'm going to prove that you 
and I can run together again.

00:20:47.880 --> 00:20:53.240
Watch the Arima Kinen, okay? I'm gonna 
cross that goal before anybody else.

00:20:56.890 --> 00:21:01.760
Y-You can't possibly win... 
not in the condition you're in.

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:03.660
I'm going to win anyway.

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:08.120
If I work hard enough to make a 
miracle happen, I know I can do it.

00:21:12.510 --> 00:21:17.240
Miracles can happen when people 
wish and strive for them.

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:19.740
I'm sure of that.

00:21:24.370 --> 00:21:25.580
Teio...

00:21:26.960 --> 00:21:30.990
When I was on the verge of giving up,
 you pulled me forward.

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:35.030
When I felt like I was going 
to break, you were by my side.

00:21:36.680 --> 00:21:40.520
You've been the kind of strong 
horse girl I could chase after.

00:21:41.850 --> 00:21:44.430
You were the one who said 
you'd wait for me.

00:21:46.390 --> 00:21:48.200
And now, it's my turn.

00:21:49.690 --> 00:21:52.160
So watch me, McQueen.

00:21:53.590 --> 00:21:54.870
Teio...

00:22:18.000 --> 00:22:18.750
Miss!

00:22:18.750 --> 00:22:20.690
Miss, you're soaked!
